 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Catalogue-grounded answers</span></div><button class="side-item"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark lucide-help-circle lucide-circle-help" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9 9.5a3 2.5 0 016 0c0 2-2 2-3 3.5"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg> Good to know <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button><p>Independent student project.<br/>No account. No checkout. Just a conversation.</p></div></aside><main class="main"><header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-title"><button class="icon-button mobile-toggle" aria-label="Open navigation"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button><span>RetailAssist <span class="subtle-plus">/</span> <span class="companion-label">your shopping companion</span></span></div><div class="topbar-right"><span class="private-badge"><span></span> Anonymous session</span><button class="icon-button" aria-label="About this project"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg></button></div></header><div class="chat-scroll"><section class="welcome" aria-labelledby="welcome-heading"><div class="welcome-flower"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-leaf" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 20a10 10 0 0010-10 25.9 25.9 0 00-1.04-7.281 1 1 0 00-1.755-.325C15.833 5.5 13 5.5 9.8 6.1A7 7 0 0011 20"></path><path d="M2 21a5 5 0 012.911-4.544C7.613 15.212 8.351 15.24 11 13"></path></svg><span>✧</span></div><div class="welcome-eyebrow">A LITTLE HELP FINDING YOUR EVERYDAY</div><h1 id="welcome-heading">What feels like<br/><span>a good find today?</span></h1><p class="welcome-intro">From your morning oats to your evening tea,<br class="desktop-break"/> let’s find something that fits your routine.</p><div class="welcome-evidence"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><span>Approved Healthy U catalogue<!-- --> · source references included</span></div><div class="example-grid"><button><span class="example-icon">☀</span><strong>A better breakfast</strong><span>Find breakfast oats under KSh 1,000.</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles lucide-stars example-spark" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a